    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, a living necros gains the lich template (if they are an undead or construct, they gain the rejuvenation ability of the lich template), removing their Constitution score. In addition, their phylactery comes into existence instantly, requiring no effort or payment from the necros to do so.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/necros#toc25\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
